        <h1 class="dui-hero-title" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/chelsea-drunk-driving-dui-owi.astro:gn6nna">Chelsea DUI Lawyer 38 Years Experience - Joseph A. Simon</h1>
        <p class="dui-hero-intro" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/chelsea-drunk-driving-dui-owi.astro:mx3xcd">Providing Local, Experienced, and Established Successful Defenses Of Chelsea DUI Cases for Over 38 Years</p>
        <p class="dui-hero-description" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/chelsea-drunk-driving-dui-owi.astro:mx3xcc">Joe Simon - Chelsea, MI DUI OWI Attorney, Listed in Best Lawyers in America, Recognized a Michigan Super Lawyer.</p>
